---
import OpenToWork from './OpenToWork.astro';
---

<main class="flex flex-col gap-5 px-32 py-32">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
    <OpenToWork />
    <span class="text-(--color-muted) font-mono tracking-tight">
      $ hola, soy Ezequiel · Backend Developer.
    </span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="font-display font-normal tracking-tight max-w-5xl text-9xl leading-36">
    Construyo APIs REST en .NET y Java.
  </h1>
  <p class="max-w-140 text-(--color-muted) text-[17px]">
    Estoy terminando la Tecnicatura en Desarrollo Web Full Stack (UNLaM). Acá están tres proyectos
    con las decisiones de arquitectura que tomé en cada uno.
  </p>
  <div class="flex gap-5 mt-6 items-center">
    <button class="font-sans border hover:bg-black transition duration-100 hover:text-white ease-in hover:border-white rounded-3xl text-(--color-muted) border-(--color-border)">
      <a href="#" class="px-4 py-3 block">
        (01) Ver proyectos
      </a>
    </button>
    <button class="font-sans border hover:bg-black transition hover:text-white duration-100 ease-in hover:border-white rounded-3xl text-(--color-muted) border-(--color-border)">
      <a href="#" class="px-4 py-3 block">
        (02) Descargar CV
      </a>
    </button>
    <button class="font-sans border hover:bg-black transition hover:text-white hover:border-white duration-200 rounded-3xl text-(--color-muted) border-(--color-border)">
      <a href="#" class="px-4 py-3 block">
        (03) Hablemos!
      </a>
    </button>
  </div>
</main>
